1
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:11,980
Welcome back! This is the last episode: show day, from the night before to the last cue.

2
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:18,090
The day before, open Settings, Tools, and press Check. Here, a new version is out.

3
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:25,220
Leave it for after the event. Installing closes LayerCue, and the audience screen goes dark.

4
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:34,500
Then press Import external files on the Files and YouTube page, until every file is inside the media folder. Episode 15.

5
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:44,500
Run the whole show once, on the real screens. A red card says a file is missing. Here, the welcome video was renamed.

6
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:50,110
Right-click it, and choose Locate file. Pick the file, and the card is relinked.

7
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:56,300
Listen to every video and song once, at show volume.

8
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:01,950
In Settings, Stage, turn on Lock editing while live.

9
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:09,470
Now, while a screen is on, the first slide you send locks editing. The lock lights up in the status bar.

10
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:16,220
Slides still go out. But a stray drag can't move a card, or change a slide, mid-show.

11
00:01:18,290 --> 00:01:23,300
It unlocks by itself when every screen is off. A lock you set by hand stays.

12
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:31,790
If a cable comes out, LayerCue says so: Output screen disconnected. The on-air chip shows a ring.

13
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:36,490
Plug it back in, and it comes right back by itself.

14
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:40,690
A message always says what happened, and what to do.

15
00:01:42,710 --> 00:01:46,660
After the last slide: Clear the stage, and switch the screens off.

16
00:01:47,930 --> 00:01:54,020
Then quit. With a screen still on, LayerCue warns you first: quitting will black out the screen.

17
00:01:54,690 --> 00:01:58,070
Clear, power off, quit. That order, every time.

18
00:02:00,090 --> 00:02:03,300
You can now run a show from the night before to pack down.

19
00:02:03,970 --> 00:02:09,380
When a new version ships, a What's New episode joins this playlist. Thanks for watching!

